Vercel Web Analytics Implementation Report
==========================================

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics has been successfully configured for this React + Vite project.

## Current Status
The project already has Vercel Web Analytics properly installed and configured. After verification against the latest official documentation from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart, I confirmed that the implementation is correct and follows best practices.

## Implementation Details

### Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1
- **Location**: Listed in dependencies in `north/package.json`
- **Status**: ✅ Installed and up-to-date

### Configuration
- **File Modified**: `north/src/App.jsx`
- **Import Statement**: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/react";`
- **Component Placement**: The `<Analytics />` component is correctly placed inside the BrowserRouter component at the root level of the App

### Code Implementation
The Analytics component is integrated in App.jsx as follows:
```jsx
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/react";
// ... other imports

function App() {
  return (
    <BrowserRouter>
      <Routes>
        {/* ... routes ... */}
      </Routes>
      {/* ... other components ... */}
      <Analytics />
    </BrowserRouter>
  );
}
```

