## Framework Details
- **Framework**: React 19.2.8
- **Build Tool**: Vite 8.2.0
- **Router**: React Router DOM 7.18.2

## Next Steps for Deployment
To enable Web Analytics tracking:
1. Ensure the project is deployed to Vercel
2. Navigate to the Vercel dashboard
3. Select "Analytics" from the sidebar
4. Choose this project and click "Enable" in the header
5. Analytics will start tracking page views automatically once enabled

## Notes
- The implementation follows the exact pattern recommended in the official Vercel documentation
- No additional configuration is required for basic page view tracking
- The Analytics component is lightweight and will not impact page performance
- For custom event tracking (available on Pro/Enterprise plans), additional configuration can be added as needed

